stereo-pose-pipeline
Apache-2.0

This tree does not vendor third-party sources listed below. Install them as
runtime dependencies and follow their licenses.

Runtime / tools
- NVIDIA CUDA, TensorRT, GStreamer NVMM, NvBuf/VIC: NVIDIA SDKs
- OpenCV: Apache-2.0
- NumPy: BSD
- Ultralytics YOLO26-pose: see Ultralytics license
  (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics). This repo ships TensorRT
  engines built from YOLO26n-pose for Jetson; .pt is not included.

Numerical references (not copied into this repository)
- Ultralytics LetterBox / OpenCV INTER_LINEAR geometry
- Geekgineer/YOLOs-CPP getScalePad and postprocessV26 (AGPL-3.0 upstream;
  this project reimplements the mapping in Python/CUDA)

COCO-17 keypoint layout is used as the skeleton convention.
